From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: add the GalaxyCore GC8613 sensor driver

Add a mainline V4L2 subdev driver for the GalaxyCore GC8613 4K sensor,
ported from the Ingenic vendor sensor driver (sensor_gc8613_t41).  The
driver exposes the controls the open-ISP V4L2 bridge needs and carries
the vendor's log2-Q16 gain column in the gain table comments so the
bridge LUT can be derived without the vendor source.

WARNING: this driver has not been validated on hardware.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/gc8613.c
@@ -0,0 +1,885 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * GalaxyCore GC8613 CMOS Image Sensor Driver
+ *
+ * The register sequences and gain table are adapted from the Ingenic
+ * vendor sensor driver (sensor_gc8613_t41).
+ *
+ * WARNING: this driver has not been validated on hardware.
+ */
+
